<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA to Western Australia Treasury bonds.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA to Western Australia Treasury bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Monday it had assigned its AA rating to Western Australia Treasury Corp's 12 billion yen of 6.05 percent dual-currency yen/Australian dollar bonds due on May 8, 2000.</p>
<p>The agency said the outlook for the rating was positive.</p>
</text>
